# CLI-managed local state: env values, provider state, journals
.ggg/
# This repository's own registry snapshot signature is a local build artifact:
# the core catalog is consumed as a directory source, which needs no signature.
# Anchored to the root on purpose — a distributed registry's signature IS a
# published artifact, and an unanchored pattern would silently refuse to commit
# templates/external-registry/registry.snapshot.sig.
/registry.snapshot.sig
